        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86385, Woven Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Carbon Fiber Silver Bar Cabinet Pull is available in 9 different lengths ranging from 3 inches up to 16 inches, so you'll be sure to find the perfect fit. Choose from satin nickel or polished chrome finishes. This Woven Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Pull made by Emtek comes packed with the mounting hardware for easy installation.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/silver-carbon-fiber-cabinet-knob-emtek-86370\"> <b>Silver Carbon Fiber Cabinet Knob</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/silver-carbon-fiber-bin-pull-emtek-86374\"><b>Silver Carbon Fiber Bin Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Carbon Fiber Bar Pull in Silver:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Carbon Fiber and Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86385-specifications.pdf?v=1704262351\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Carbon Fiber Silver Bar Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86385-specifications.gif?v=1704354690\" width=\"600\" height=\"182\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86385 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 9 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86385:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86386:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86387:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86388:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86389:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86390:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86391:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86392:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86393:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
